### INK NFS Backend API Tests
### IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client format / VS Code REST Client
### Click the green arrow next to each request to run it
###
### For IntelliJ IDEA:
### 1. Select environment: production or local (top right corner)
### 2. Or create http-client.env.json file (already created)
###
### For VS Code REST Client:
### 1. Variables are defined below using @variable = value syntax
### 2. Use {{variable}} in requests

### Variables (VS Code REST Client)
@baseUrl = http://193.57.137.90:8000
@localUrl = http://localhost:8000
@contentType = application/json

###

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Get Public Key (JWKS)
GET {{baseUrl}}/.well-known/jwks.json

### 3. Enroll Package - Register new package
POST {{baseUrl}}/enroll
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "order_id": "ORDER-12345",
  "nfc_uid": "04:1A:2B:3C:4D:5E:01",
  "nfc_token": "token_test_abc123",
  "photo_urls": [
    "https://example.com/photo1.jpg",
    "https://example.com/photo2.jpg",
    "https://example.com/photo3.jpg",
    "https://example.com/photo4.jpg"
  ],
  "photo_hashes": [
    "hash1234567890abcdef",
    "hash2234567890abcdef",
    "hash3234567890abcdef",
    "hash4234567890abcdef"
  ],
  "shipping_address_gps": {
    "lat": 40.7128,
    "lng": -74.0060
  },
  "customer_phone_last4": "1234",
  "warehouse_gps": {
    "lat": 40.7580,
    "lng": -73.9855
  }
}

### 4. Verify Delivery - GPS distance < 100m (auto pass)
POST {{baseUrl}}/verify
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "nfc_token": "token_test_abc123",
  "delivery_gps": {
    "lat": 40.7129,
    "lng": -74.0061
  },
  "device_info": "iPhone 14 Pro, iOS 17"
}

### 5. Verify Delivery - GPS distance > 100m (requires phone)
POST {{baseUrl}}/verify
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "nfc_token": "token_test_abc123",
  "delivery_gps": {
    "lat": 40.8000,
    "lng": -74.1000
  },
  "device_info": "iPhone 14 Pro, iOS 17",
  "phone_last4": "1234"
}

### 6. Retrieve Proof - Replace with actual proof_id from enroll response
GET {{baseUrl}}/retrieve/proof_ba1687858ce850506a26db2f

### 7. Test Error - Invalid token
POST {{baseUrl}}/verify
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "nfc_token": "invalid_token_xyz",
  "delivery_gps": {
    "lat": 40.7129,
    "lng": -74.0061
  }
}

### 8. Test Error - Missing required fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/enroll
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "order_id": "ORDER-12345"
}

### 9. Test Error - Duplicate enrollment (same nfc_token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/enroll
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "order_id": "ORDER-99999",
  "nfc_uid": "04:1A:2B:3C:4D:5E:6F",
  "nfc_token": "token_test_abc123",
  "photo_urls": [
    "https://example.com/photo1.jpg",
    "https://example.com/photo2.jpg",
    "https://example.com/photo3.jpg",
    "https://example.com/photo4.jpg"
  ],
  "photo_hashes": [
    "hash1234567890abcdef",
    "hash2234567890abcdef",
    "hash3234567890abcdef",
    "hash4234567890abcdef"
  ],
  "shipping_address_gps": {
    "lat": 40.7128,
    "lng": -74.0060
  },
  "customer_phone_last4": "1234",
  "warehouse_gps": {
    "lat": 40.7580,
